OL,3,GNEWSASamaritans closing at 'worst      
OL,4,Atime', say volunteers                  
OL,6,FThe loss of a Samaritans branch which  
OL,7,Fis due to close in less than a week    
OL,8,Fwould come at the "worst time" in the  
OL,9,Frun up to the festive period,          
OL,10,Fvolunteers say.                        
OL,12,FIn October, Samaritans confirmed that  
OL,13,Fit planned to close the Worthing branch
OL,14,Fof its listening, citing the need to   
OL,15,Fbuild a "more sustainable service for  
OL,16,Fthe future".                           
OL,18,FA petition calling for the decision to 
OL,19,Fbe reversed has been signed by over    
OL,20,F28,000 people, and was delivered to the
OL,21,Fcharity's head office in Ewell, Surrey,
OL,22,Fon Monday.                             
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
