OL,3,GNEWSASamaritans closing at 'worst      
OL,4,Atime', say volunteers                  
OL,6,FJim Pollard, who has volunteered for   
OL,7,Fover 10 years, said: "We have over 100 
OL,8,Fvolunteers and we are taking them out  
OL,9,Fof the system just before Christmas."  
